---
title: Candied Pecans
description: The Wisconsin fam's signature recipe.
servings: 6
image: https://www.inspiredtaste.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Easy-Candied-Pecans-1200.jpg
---

Preheat oven to 250*F.

Pour @egg whites{2} over @pecans{2%lbs}(halved) and shake in a large sealable bag.

In a #small bowl{}, mix @water{1/2%tbsp}, @vanilla extract{1/2%tbsp}, @sugar{1%cup}, @salt{3/4%tsp}, and @cinnamon{1/2%tsp}.

Add the sugar mixture to the pecan bag and shake until evenly coated.

Spread the pecans onto a #baking sheet{}.

Put the pecans in the oven for ~{1%hour}, flipping the pecans with a spatula every ~{15%minutes}.